{"id":"3f0456bd04aa601f","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md","title":"ZFC PCF Exact Upper Bound","display":"df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound — ZFC PCF Exact Upper Bound","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound","58-df-zfc-pcf2-exact-upper-bound"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound — ZFC PCF Exact Upper Bound","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound</span><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-exact-upper-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound — ZFC PCF Exact Upper Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eddbbbc6fc10dcfa\" href=\"?note=eddbbbc6fc10dcfa\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fd3c35fd522d89ac\" href=\"?note=fd3c35fd522d89ac\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\vec f,g,h\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\vec f,g,h\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec f:\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\to\\prod A\">\\(\\vec f:\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\to\\prod A\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S\\)</span> (proper-ideal and strict mod-ideal order predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcfExactUpperBound}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcfExactUpperBound}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (canonical predicate and historical alias)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}exact\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcfExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S(A,J)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\vec f:\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\to\\prod A\\land g\\in\\prod A\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,\\vec f(\\alpha),g)\\land\\forall h\\in\\prod A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,h,g)\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,h,\\vec f(\\alpha))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}exact\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcfExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S(A,J)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\vec f:\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\to\\prod A\\land g\\in\\prod A\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,\\vec f(\\alpha),g)\\land\\forall h\\in\\prod A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,h,g)\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,h,\\vec f(\\alpha))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}exact\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,h)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcfExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,h)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}exact\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,h)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcfExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,h)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Exactness means that the sequence is cofinal below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> in the strict mod-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> order, not merely that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> is a least common upper bound.</li>\n<li>The pcf2 name is retained as an alias of the canonical four-argument predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"eddbbbc6fc10dcfa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"fd3c35fd522d89ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-pcf3-eventual-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,J,\\vec f,g,h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec f:\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\to\\prod A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcfExactUpperBound}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}exact\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcfExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S(A,J)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\vec f:\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\to\\prod A\\land g\\in\\prod A\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,\\vec f(\\alpha),g)\\land\\forall h\\in\\prod A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,h,g)\\to\\exists\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3EventualOrder}_S(A,J,h,\\vec f(\\alpha))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}exact\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,h)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcfExactUpperBound}_S(A,J,\\vec f,h)","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false}],"bytes":1975,"backlinks":[{"id":"89edd76ad2833409","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S$ (exact-upper-bound predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md]])"},{"id":"7dd692dab6c2daa2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\\subseteq V^4$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ExactUpperBound}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3029","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound.md|58-df-zfc-pcf-exact-upper-bound]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","eddbbbc6fc10dcfa","fd3c35fd522d89ac","b82cea6742372d50","5582a281f15a33c2"]}